- Scrollable chat area.
- Fixed bottom composer.
- Safe-area padding for iPhone notch, Dynamic Island, and Android gesture bar.
- Keyboard must push the composer above it.
- No horizontal page scrolling.
- No overlapping elements.

Mobile header:
- Height: 56px.
- Left: back button.
- Center: GuruAI avatar + “GuruAI” + “by HarshGuruJi”.
- Right: three-dot menu.
- Below header or inside menu, show:
  - Active model.
  - Remaining requests.
  - Theme selector.
- Three-dot menu options:
  - New chat
  - Chat history
  - Change AI model
  - Preferences
  - Clear chat
  - Upgrade plan
  - Help & support
